{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04928","headline":"奉和立春游苑迎春应制 · 卢藏用","name":"奉和立春游苑迎春应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天游龙辇驻城闉，上苑迟光晚更新。\n瑶台半入黄山路，玉槛傍临玄霸津。\n梅香欲待歌前落，兰气先过酒上春。\n幸预柏台称献寿，愿陪千亩及农晨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢藏用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04928.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04928","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}